 "tagline": "UnCruise's largest Alaska ship, on its most active week.",
 "answer": "Wilderness Legacy is UnCruise's largest Alaska vessel: 192 feet, 88 guests in 44 cabins, with the most spacious viewing decks in the fleet and its only elevator. From April to September she sails Wild, Woolly and Wow, seven nights round trip from Juneau to LeConte Glacier, Kuiu Island, Chichagof and Glacier Bay's outer bay, the most active week UnCruise offers. Fares run from $5,300 per person.",
